336
00:35:46,156 --> 00:35:47,856
どうぞ、トワ様、トワ様どうぞ。
Go ahead, Towa-sama, Towa-sama, go ahead.

337
00:35:47,856 --> 00:35:52,256
こよりね、トワ様の声でも再生されてたもん、合いすぎて。
Koyori could even hear it in Towa-sama's voice, it suited you so much.

338
00:35:52,256 --> 00:35:54,256
本当に？
Really?

339
00:35:54,256 --> 00:35:55,856
え、歌えてたかな？
Uh, did I sing it well?

340
00:35:55,856 --> 00:35:58,456
え、超よかった！
Uh, it was super good!

341
00:35:58,456 --> 00:36:00,156
意外と緊張しちゃったんだけど、やだちょっと。
I actually got surprisingly nervous, oh my.

342
00:36:00,156 --> 00:36:02,456
え、めっちゃよかった！こよりが一生緊張してたんで、
No, it was amazing! Koyori was nervous the whole time,

343
00:36:02,456 --> 00:36:04,256
すごい硬かった。
so I was really stiff.

344
00:36:04,256 --> 00:36:04,856
うそ！
No way!

345
00:40:02,997 --> 00:40:05,997
こんにちは！
Hello!

346
00:40:05,997 --> 00:40:07,697
みこち！
Miko-chi!

347
00:40:07,697 --> 00:40:09,797
来ましたね！
You made it!

348
00:40:09,797 --> 00:40:11,497
こよちゃんの枠でね
Here on Koyo-chan's stream...

349
00:40:11,497 --> 00:40:12,997
ええ
Yeah...

350
00:40:12,997 --> 00:40:16,497
ちょっとドキドキの2人のデュエットをさせて
We're going to perform a slightly nerve-wracking duet

351
00:40:16,497 --> 00:40:18,497
いただこうかなと思います！
together!

352
00:40:18,497 --> 00:40:19,797
ぜひお願いします
Please do!

353
00:40:19,797 --> 00:40:21,997
では、準備はよろしいですか？
So, are you ready?

354
00:40:21,997 --> 00:40:22,997
はい
Yes.

355
00:40:22,997 --> 00:40:23,697
はい！
Yes!

356
00:40:23,697 --> 00:40:26,197
それではお聞きください。せーの
Now, please listen... ready, set...

357
00:40:26,197 --> 00:40:29,997
スペシャルメドレー！
Special Medley!

358
00:40:33,797 --> 00:40:36,197
息をしている
I'm breathing,

359
00:40:36,197 --> 00:40:39,497
だから生きている
so I am alive.

360
00:40:39,697 --> 00:40:45,497
何度もずっと言葉を贈ってきたんだ//
I've sent my words to you over and over again.

361
00:40:45,797 --> 00:40:48,297
息をしている
I'm breathing,

362
00:40:48,297 --> 00:40:50,997
世に見えている
visible to the world.

363
00:40:50,997 --> 00:40:56,997
青が染み出す 私にとっての何か
The blue seeps out, becoming something to me.

364
00:40:58,997 --> 00:41:03,997
鼓動がドクドクしている
My heart is throbbing.

365
00:41:04,497 --> 00:41:10,497
ここはいつも変わらずに
This place always remains unchanged,

366
00:41:10,497 --> 00:41:13,497
急かし続ける
constantly rushing...

367
00:41:13,497 --> 00:41:17,497
ボタン一つの命
a life controlled by a single button.

368
00:41:19,997 --> 00:41:25,497
最後まで私のこと覚えててくれるの？
Will you remember me until the very end?

369
00:41:25,997 --> 00:41:31,997
消えてしまいそうなの わかってよ わかってよ ねぇ
I feel like I'm about to disappear, please understand, please understand, hey.

370
00:41:31,997 --> 00:41:37,497
本当は本当はどうなの いずれは卒業するんでしょう
What is the truth, really? We'll graduate eventually, right?

371
00:41:37,997 --> 00:41:43,997
日常に戻ったら 私は いなくなるの
When things go back to daily life, will I disappear?

372
00:41:43,997 --> 00:41:46,997
いのちのような
As if experiencing...

373
00:41:46,997 --> 00:41:50,497
夢を見てるよ
a dream like life itself.

374
00:41:50,497 --> 00:41:53,497
またね バイバイ
See you later, bye bye.

375
00:42:25,497 --> 00:42:29,297
自信なんてなかった 1人だってよかった
I had no confidence, I was fine being alone,

376
00:42:29,297 --> 00:42:32,997
プライドに隠れて
hiding behind my pride.

377
00:42:33,497 --> 00:42:40,497
誰かの視線気になってばかりで閉じこもってた
Always worrying about how others saw me, I shut myself away.

378
00:42:41,197 --> 00:42:44,497
嫌いだなんて思えなくて
I couldn't bring myself to hate it,

379
00:42:44,497 --> 00:42:48,497
笑えなかったんだ
and I couldn't laugh.

380
00:42:48,797 --> 00:42:52,997
涙で滲んだ画面の向こう
Beyond the screen blurred with tears,

381
00:42:52,997 --> 00:42:55,997
不意に溶けた心
my heart suddenly melted.

382
00:42:56,197 --> 00:42:59,997
触れてくれた声
The voice that reached out to me,

383
00:42:59,997 --> 00:43:03,997
君のおかげで笑えたよ
thanks to you, I was able to smile.

384
00:43:04,497 --> 00:43:07,497
その言葉がずっと
Those words will always...

385
00:43:07,497 --> 00:43:11,497
この胸を灯す
...light up this chest of mine

386
00:43:11,797 --> 00:43:16,997
ただ一つの光
as my one and only light.

387
00:43:17,497 --> 00:43:20,997
Fire, take me higher

388
00:43:20,997 --> 00:43:24,997
消えそうな声を歌に変えて
turning a voice about to disappear into a song.

389
00:43:25,197 --> 00:43:29,197
弱さ抱きしめながら
While embracing my weakness,

390
00:43:29,197 --> 00:43:33,497
届けと叫ぶように燃やす
I burn it as if crying out to reach you...

391
00:43:33,497 --> 00:43:36,997
炎を
...the flame.

392
00:43:36,997 --> 00:43:40,997
炎を
The flame.

393
00:43:40,997 --> 00:43:44,997
Fire, take me higher

394
00:43:44,997 --> 00:43:47,997
君の明日を
I want to light up...

395
00:43:47,997 --> 00:43:50,997
照らしたい
...your tomorrow.

396
00:44:15,497 --> 00:44:20,997
黙ってうつむいて 空の色さえ
Looking down in silence, even the color of the sky...

397
00:44:20,997 --> 00:44:25,497
知らない私の
...was unknown to me.

398
00:44:27,497 --> 00:44:32,197
声で君が笑った
Since you laughed at my voice,

399
00:44:32,197 --> 00:44:37,497
あの日から世界は眩しくて
the world has been so bright.

400
00:44:37,797 --> 00:44:43,997
私は私を好きになって
I've come to like myself,

401
00:44:43,997 --> 00:44:48,997
なくさないように息をする
and I breathe so I won't lose it.

402
00:45:02,145 --> 00:45:06,345
暗闇のような青の
In the middle of the dark,

403
00:45:06,345 --> 00:45:13,245
真ん中で今も泣いているのは
blue-like darkness, the reason I'm still crying...

404
00:45:14,345 --> 00:45:18,445
君が写る世界が
is because the world reflecting you

405
00:45:18,445 --> 00:45:24,845
悲しくなるほど優しいから
is kind enough to make me sad.

406
00:45:24,845 --> 00:45:31,845
苦しくなるほど遠いから
Because it's far enough to make me suffer.

407
00:45:32,545 --> 00:45:37,345
チクチクとウズウズ甘い熱を
The tingling and aching sweet heat,

408
00:45:37,345 --> 00:45:43,845
閉じ込めていたのに 痛くて零れた
I kept it locked away, but it spilled out from the pain.

409
00:45:44,545 --> 00:45:50,345
きっと私と体の 体の間にある
Surely, even the extremely thin skin

410
00:45:50,345 --> 00:45:56,645
ひどく薄い皮膚さえ もう邪魔になるくらい
between my body and yours is almost getting in the way now.

411
00:45:57,045 --> 00:46:00,645
その鼓膜 その心臓
If I could touch that eardrum,

412
00:46:00,645 --> 00:46:07,845
ずっと奥に触れたら 君はまた笑うのかな
and that heart deep inside, would you laugh again?

413
00:46:10,345 --> 00:46:15,145
届いて 君まで届け
Please, let it reach you.

414
00:46:33,245 --> 00:46:36,845
I recognize the face staring back at me today

415
00:46:36,845 --> 00:46:39,745
I guess it's time to change

416
00:46:39,745 --> 00:46:40,845
La la la la la

417
00:46:41,045 --> 00:46:43,845
When I don't feel like myself

418
00:46:43,845 --> 00:46:45,845
I don't need someone else

419
00:46:45,845 --> 00:46:47,245
Guess I'll just change my dress

420
00:46:47,245 --> 00:46:48,845
And energy will stay stateless

421
00:46:49,045 --> 00:46:52,845
You can't cage me up, I'm the key

422
00:46:52,845 --> 00:46:55,645
I can't move on in a heartbeat

423
00:46:55,645 --> 00:46:57,845
They can feel, feel, feel my vibe

424
00:46:57,845 --> 00:47:00,645
Feel, feel, feel my vibe, like me

425
00:47:00,645 --> 00:47:03,845
In the night, I'm just moving to the rhythm of a different life

426
00:47:03,845 --> 00:47:05,945
They can feel, feel, feel my vibe

427
00:47:05,945 --> 00:47:07,945
Feel, feel, feel my vibe, like me

428
00:47:07,945 --> 00:47:11,345
Step back, cuz tomorrow I'm the girl you met tonight

429
00:47:11,845 --> 00:47:13,845
Switch it up, ooh-ooh-ooh

430
00:47:13,845 --> 00:47:15,845
Switch it up, ooh-ooh-ooh

431
00:47:15,845 --> 00:47:18,645
I just want to feel my heart, just feel my heart

432
00:47:18,645 --> 00:47:20,145
Go boom boom boom

433
00:47:20,145 --> 00:47:21,945
Switch it up, ooh-ooh-ooh

434
00:47:21,945 --> 00:47:23,545
Switch it up, ooh-ooh-ooh

435
00:47:23,545 --> 00:47:25,245
Every time I've had enough of who I was

436
00:47:25,245 --> 00:47:28,845
I swear that I'll just switch it up again

437
00:47:40,845 --> 00:47:46,145
いいないいな このまま 溢れ出しちゃうくらいに
It's great, it's great, just like this, so much that it overflows!

