飛んでけ羞恥心
Fly away, embarrassment!

444
00:48:10,845 --> 00:48:13,545
持ってけ白衣
Take it away, lab coat!

445
00:48:14,045 --> 00:48:17,045
ピンクになってよ 全人類
Turn pink, all of humanity!

446
00:48:17,045 --> 00:48:19,945
誰も彼も全部
Everyone and everything, all of it!

447
00:48:19,945 --> 00:48:24,845
いいでしょ いいよね 絶対楽しいよ
It's fine, right? It's good, right? It's definitely going to be fun!

448
00:48:25,645 --> 00:48:31,645
ピンクになってこ 全人類
Let's turn pink, all of humanity!

449
00:48:31,645 --> 00:48:36,845
ピンクになってよ 全人類
Turn pink, all of humanity!

450
